  "description": "Mark an enum with [VisitorGenerator] and the source generator creates visitor interfaces and strongly-typed Accept extension methods that dispatch by enum member.\n      It also supports [VisitorToMethod] on stateless struct visitors to generate ergonomic enum extension wrappers, including tuple argument flattening.\n      This helps replace error-prone manual switches while keeping allocation-free struct visitor paths.",
